### SharePoker API 测试

### 1. 测试服务器状态
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### 2. 上传第一个玩家的手牌（使用图片URL或Base64）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player1",
	"device_id": "device001",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/player1.png"
}

### 3. 上传第二个玩家的手牌（使用Base64图片）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player2",
	"device_id": "device002",
	"image": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAE0AAAA5CAYAAABzuqZnAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAARnQU1BAACxjwv8YQUAAAAJcEhZcwAAEnQAABJ0Ad5mH3gAAB3JSU..."
}

### 4. 上传第三个玩家的手牌（覆盖上传）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player3",
	"device_id": "device003",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/player3.png"
}

### 5. 测试设备唯一标识覆盖功能 - 使用相同设备ID但不同用户名
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "corrected_player_name",
	"device_id": "device001",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/corrected_image.png"
}

### 6. 查看牌局信息（验证用户名被覆盖）
GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/123456

### 7. 再次使用相同设备ID上传（测试持续覆盖）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "final_player_name",
	"device_id": "device001",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/final_image.png"
}

### 8. 最终验证
GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/123456

### 11. 上传日志
POST http://localhost:3001/api/log/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"device_id": "device001",
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player1",
	"level": "info",
	"message": "客户端启动并选择了图片，准备上传。"
}

### 12. 查询日志（按game_code）
GET http://localhost:3001/api/logs?game_code=123456&limit=50

### 13. 查询日志（按device_id）
GET http://localhost:3001/api/logs?device_id=device001&limit=50
